# Reflexia has no build-time secrets.
#
# AI is off by default. A person who wants it pastes their own Gemini key in
# Profile -> AI inside the app; it is kept in the app's keystore on their
# device and is never part of a build. Do not add a VITE_ variable for it:
# anything in a VITE_ variable ships in the bundle (see
# src/services/aiService.ts and tests/unit/aiGate.test.ts).
